    "title": "Registration opens for 'Moonlight Loop' bike ride benefiting Columbus Animal Care - NewsBreak",
    "text": "10 hours ago The ride will take place on Saturday, August 22, at 9 p.m. and will start and finish at the Bartholomew County Library Plaza. The registration fee is $35 per rider, now through June 30th. The cost will increase to $40 from July 1 to August 21, and will be $45 on the day of the event. Sign up now, here. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
